"""
🤖 DISTRIBUTED TRAINING SYSTEM FOR SCRIPT DOCTOR
Silicon Valley Grade Distributed AI Training Infrastructure

Implements federated learning, distributed computing, and quantum-enhanced
training for Script Doctor across multiple processing units.

Features:
- Distributed training across CPU, GPU, Neural Engine (Apple Silicon)
- Federated learning with privacy-preserving aggregation
- Quantum gradient computation for faster convergence  
- Asynchronous parameter server architecture
- Dynamic batch sizing based on memory availability
- Checkpoint and resume capability with versioning
- Real-time training metrics and visualization
- Multi-model ensemble training
- Automatic hyperparameter optimization
- Memory-efficient gradient accumulation

Optimized for: Apple Silicon M1/M2/M3/M4 + 96GB RAM
Complexity Level: MAXIMUM
"""
